              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "der Kofferraum — \"the boot (of a car; US: trunk)\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Die Koffer passen nicht alle in den Kofferraum. The suitcases do not all fit in the boot."
